       "type": "callout",
       "style": "exam",
       "title": "On the exam...",
       "text": "Keep three terms straight. NAV is computed once daily; MARKET PRICE moves all day; TRACKING ERROR compares the fund's return to the INDEX's return, not to its own NAV."
