    "Differentiate discretionary from non-discretionary accounts and identify what authority requires written power of attorney versus what a registered rep may decide alone.",
    "Compare cash and margin accounts and contrast fee-based versus commission-based account arrangements.",
    "Outline the account-opening process, including the four required pieces of CIP information, the new account form, trusted contact person, and transfer-on-death (TOD) registration.",
