       "type": "callout",
       "style": "tip",
       "title": "Notice requirement",
       "text": "Within two business days of placing a hold, the firm must notify the customer and the trusted contact (unless that person is suspected of the exploitation) and state the reason. Rule 2165 gives the firm a safe harbor for acting in good faith."
