   "summary": "This chapter covers the conduct rules that protect investors and market integrity: insider trading, market manipulation, fraud, churning, unauthorized and discretionary trading, selling away, and commingling, plus the anti-money laundering framework (Bank Secrecy Act, CTRs, SARs, OFAC, FinCEN, CIP) and Regulation S-P privacy protections. Mastering these prohibited activities and their penalties is essential because this material is among the most heavily tested on the SIE.",
